{
  "type": "excalidraw",
  "version": 2,
  "source": "m365-presence-power-automate",
  "elements": [
    {
      "id": "title",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 260,
      "y": 40,
      "width": 1680,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "Power Automate: Read group members and batch-fetch Teams presence",
      "fontSize": 30,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle"
    },
    {
      "id": "subtitle",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 300,
      "y": 120,
      "width": 1600,
      "height": 60,
      "text": "M365 groups and security groups | pages through users, then sends batches of up to 650 IDs",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle"
    },
    {
      "id": "step1",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 500,
      "y": 210,
      "width": 1000,
      "height": 140,
      "strokeColor": "#0078D4",
      "backgroundColor": "#CFE4FA",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roundness": { "type": 3 },
      "boundElements": [{ "type": "text", "id": "step1text" }]
    },
    {
      "id": "step1text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 540,
      "y": 225,
      "width": 920,
      "height": 110,
      "text": "1. Trigger and group input\nUse a recurrence or manual trigger. Supply the Entra group object ID.",
      "fontSize": 21,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "step1"
    },
    {
      "id": "arrow1",
      "type": "arrow",
      "x": 1000,
      "y": 350,
      "width": 0,
      "height": 50,
      "points": [[0, 0], [0, 50]],
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "endArrowhead": "arrow"
    },
    {
      "id": "step2",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 500,
      "y": 400,
      "width": 1000,
      "height": 190,
      "strokeColor": "#862e9c",
      "backgroundColor": "#E8DAEF",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roundness": { "type": 3 },
      "boundElements": [{ "type": "text", "id": "step2text" }]
    },
    {
      "id": "step2text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 540,
      "y": 415,
      "width": 920,
      "height": 160,
      "text": "2. Read group membership from Microsoft Graph\nDirect users: GET /groups/{id}/members/microsoft.graph.user?$select=id\nFor nested security groups, use /transitiveMembers/microsoft.graph.user.\nUse an Entra-authenticated HTTP action or a separate Graph connector.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "step2"
    },
    {
      "id": "arrow2",
      "type": "arrow",
      "x": 1000,
      "y": 590,
      "width": 0,
      "height": 50,
      "points": [[0, 0], [0, 50]],
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "endArrowhead": "arrow"
    },
    {
      "id": "step3",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 500,
      "y": 640,
      "width": 1000,
      "height": 130,
      "strokeColor": "#e67700",
      "backgroundColor": "#FFF4CE",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roundness": { "type": 3 },
      "boundElements": [{ "type": "text", "id": "step3text" }]
    },
    {
      "id": "step3text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 540,
      "y": 655,
      "width": 920,
      "height": 100,
      "text": "3. Handle pagination\nFollow every @odata.nextLink until Graph returns no next page.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "step3"
    },
    {
      "id": "arrow3",
      "type": "arrow",
      "x": 1000,
      "y": 770,
      "width": 0,
      "height": 50,
      "points": [[0, 0], [0, 50]],
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "endArrowhead": "arrow"
    },
    {
      "id": "step4",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 500,
      "y": 820,
      "width": 1000,
      "height": 130,
      "strokeColor": "#e67700",
      "backgroundColor": "#FFF4CE",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roundness": { "type": 3 },
      "boundElements": [{ "type": "text", "id": "step4text" }]
    },
    {
      "id": "step4text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 540,
      "y": 835,
      "width": 920,
      "height": 100,
      "text": "4. Normalize the member list\nKeep user objects only; collect and de-duplicate their id values.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "step4"
    },
    {
      "id": "arrow4",
      "type": "arrow",
      "x": 1000,
      "y": 950,
      "width": 0,
      "height": 50,
      "points": [[0, 0], [0, 50]],
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "endArrowhead": "arrow"
    },
    {
      "id": "step5",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 500,
      "y": 1000,
      "width": 1000,
      "height": 130,
      "strokeColor": "#107C10",
      "backgroundColor": "#DFF6DD",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roundness": { "type": 3 },
      "boundElements": [{ "type": "text", "id": "step5text" }]
    },
    {
      "id": "step5text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 540,
      "y": 1015,
      "width": 920,
      "height": 100,
      "text": "5. Split user IDs into batches\nCreate chunks of at most 650 IDs before calling the presence operation.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "step5"
    },
    {
      "id": "arrow5",
      "type": "arrow",
      "x": 1000,
      "y": 1130,
      "width": 0,
      "height": 50,
      "points": [[0, 0], [0, 50]],
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "endArrowhead": "arrow"
    },
    {
      "id": "step6",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 500,
      "y": 1180,
      "width": 1000,
      "height": 160,
      "strokeColor": "#107C10",
      "backgroundColor": "#DFF6DD",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roundness": { "type": 3 },
      "boundElements": [{ "type": "text", "id": "step6text" }]
    },
    {
      "id": "step6text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 540,
      "y": 1195,
      "width": 920,
      "height": 130,
      "text": "6. Apply to each batch: call the Teams Presence connector\nPOST /communications/getPresencesByUserId\nBody: {\"ids\": batchIds}",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "step6"
    },
    {
      "id": "throttle",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 1580,
      "y": 1180,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 210,
      "strokeColor": "#D13438",
      "backgroundColor": "#FDE7E9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roundness": { "type": 3 },
      "boundElements": [{ "type": "text", "id": "throttletext" }]
    },
    {
      "id": "throttletext",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1610,
      "y": 1200,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 170,
      "text": "429 throttling\nHonor Retry-After. If absent, use bounded exponential backoff. Stop at a retry/elapsed-time limit; never retry early.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "throttle"
    },
    {
      "id": "arrow-throttle",
      "type": "arrow",
      "x": 1500,
      "y": 1260,
      "width": 80,
      "height": 0,
      "points": [[0, 0], [80, 0]],
      "strokeColor": "#D13438",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "endArrowhead": "arrow"
    },
    {
      "id": "arrow6",
      "type": "arrow",
      "x": 1000,
      "y": 1340,
      "width": 0,
      "height": 50,
      "points": [[0, 0], [0, 50]],
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "endArrowhead": "arrow"
    },
    {
      "id": "step7",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 500,
      "y": 1390,
      "width": 1000,
      "height": 140,
      "strokeColor": "#0c8599",
      "backgroundColor": "#99e9f2",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roundness": { "type": 3 },
      "boundElements": [{ "type": "text", "id": "step7text" }]
    },
    {
      "id": "step7text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 540,
      "y": 1405,
      "width": 920,
      "height": 110,
      "text": "7. Collect and use results\nAppend each response's value array; return it or write it to an approved destination.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "step7"
    },
    {
      "id": "permission-group",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 100,
      "y": 1600,
      "width": 970,
      "height": 150,
      "strokeColor": "#862e9c",
      "backgroundColor": "#E8DAEF",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roundness": { "type": 3 },
      "boundElements": [{ "type": "text", "id": "permission-group-text" }]
    },
    {
      "id": "permission-group-text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 130,
      "y": 1615,
      "width": 910,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "Group lookup permission\nMicrosoft Graph delegated GroupMember.Read.All; use an Entra-authenticated action/connection. This is separate from the presence connector.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "permission-group"
    },
    {
      "id": "permission-presence",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 1130,
      "y": 1600,
      "width": 970,
      "height": 150,
      "strokeColor": "#0078D4",
      "backgroundColor": "#CFE4FA",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roundness": { "type": 3 },
      "boundElements": [{ "type": "text", "id": "permission-presence-text" }]
    },
    {
      "id": "permission-presence-text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1160,
      "y": 1615,
      "width": 910,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "Presence lookup permission\nThe Teams Presence connector uses delegated Presence.Read.All. The existing connector reads presence; it does not enumerate groups.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "permission-presence"
    }
